{"id":430,"title":"解答: 带乘法的嵌套循环 （专业）","summary":"详细解决具有乘法的嵌套循环复杂度分析。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9e814812-19bf-49f1-bf7a-941004731d32","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bfd7d55a-51e1-4dc4-9cc6-d85c1e78ad1e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n可为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nj = 1\nfor var in range(n):\n    while j < var:\n        sum += 1\n        j *= 2\n    print(sum)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"acd54796-32f6-4e56-9aee-3bf36c2baa84","text":"`for`外循环有 $n$ 次迭代，因为它在从`range(n)`生成的列表上迭代。 如果条件`j < var` 为真，则进入内循环。 然而，每次`j`翻倍了。 请注意，代码中的 `j` 不会重置为 $1$。 对于外循环的每次迭代，`while`内循环最多运行一次。 因此，**第 6、7 和 8 行** 总共至多各运行 $O(n)$ 次。 由于是对**最坏情况**运行时间的上限感兴趣，假设这些语句正好运行 $n$ 次。\n\n\n| 语句   | 执行次数    |\n| --- | --- |\n|   n = 10 |   1  |\n|  sum = 0  |   1  |\n|  pie = 3.14   |   1  |\n|   for var in range(n):  |   $n$  |\n|   while j < var:   |   $n$  |\n|   sum+=1;  |  $n$  |\n|  j *= 2;   |   $n$  |\n|   print(sum)  |   $n$  |\n\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n**运行时间复杂度** = $1 + 1 + 1 + n + n + n + n + n$\n\n$= 3 + 5n$\n\n要找到Big(O)时间复杂度，\n1. 删除常量 $\\Rightarrow n$\n2. 去掉低阶项 $\\Rightarrow n$\n\n\n因此，上述的 Big O 时间复杂度为 $O(n)$。\n\n","text_html":"<p><code>for</code>外循环有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span> 次迭代，因为它在从<code>range(n)</code>生成的列表上迭代。 如果条件<code>j &lt; var</code> 为真，则进入内循环。 然而，每次<code>j</code>翻倍了。 请注意，代码中的 <code>j</code> 不会重置为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>。 对于外循环的每次迭代，<code>while</code>内循环最多运行一次。 因此，<strong>第 6、7 和 8 行</strong> 总共至多各运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 次。 由于是对<strong>最坏情况</strong>运行时间的上限感兴趣，假设这些语句正好运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span> 次。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语句</th>\n<th>执行次数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>n = 10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sum = 0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pie = 3.14</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>for var in range(n):</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>while j &lt; var:</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sum+=1;</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>j *= 2;</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>print(sum)</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p><strong>运行时间复杂度</strong> = <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + 1 + 1 + n + n + n + n + n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 3 + 5n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>要找到Big(O)时间复杂度，</p>\n<ol>\n<li>删除常量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>去掉低阶项 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此，上述的 Big O 时间复杂度为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/430"}
